1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:04,850
(Howard:)It'll be like Ma's feeding us
one last time.

2
00:00:04,847 --> 00:00:07,617
(Bernadette:)I love that.

3
00:00:08,917 --> 00:00:11,417
(Raj:)Me, too.

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,390
(Sheldon:)Oh, look,
we've got enough ketchup

5
00:00:13,389 --> 00:00:15,589
(Raj:)to cover every ounce of it.

6
00:00:18,126 --> 00:00:21,726
(Penny:)I mean, who even reads
Scientific American?

7
00:00:23,164 --> 00:00:26,764
(Leonard:)It's kind of
a big deal.

8
00:00:26,769 --> 00:00:29,199
(Penny:)If it's such a big deal,
how come the biggest celebrity

9
00:00:29,205 --> 00:00:31,735
(Penny:)they could get for the cover
is a molecule?

10
00:00:33,608 --> 00:00:35,608
(Leonard:)Can we please just
stop talking about it?

11
00:00:35,611 --> 00:00:37,581
(Amy:)I'm sorry.
What can I do?

12
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,710
(Leonard:)Nothing, I'm fine.
(sighs)

13
00:00:39,715 --> 00:00:41,985
(Sheldon:)No, no.
I'm gonna cheer you up.

14
00:00:41,984 --> 00:00:43,714
(clears throat)

15
00:00:43,719 --> 00:00:45,649
(Penny:)Here we go.

16
00:00:45,654 --> 00:00:46,984
(Leonard:)What are we doing?

17
00:00:46,989 --> 00:00:48,789
(Penny:)I am taking you shopping.
Oh.

18
00:00:48,791 --> 00:00:52,461
(Penny:)My baby is sad, and I'm gonna
make him happy again.

19
00:00:52,461 --> 00:00:54,291
(Leonard:)Look, I know shopping
cheers you up,

20
00:00:54,296 --> 00:00:56,266
(Leonard:)but it's just not
really my thing.

21
00:00:56,265 --> 00:00:57,895
(Penny:)Well, what about
this helicopter

22
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,630
(Penny:)you control with an iPad?

23
00:00:59,635 --> 00:01:02,505
(Leonard:)Does it have
a camera in it?

